{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:MassTheory.TowerBindingEnergy","@type":"LeanModule","name":"MassTheory.TowerBindingEnergy","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.Log.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Topology.Algebra.InfiniteSum.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.BigOperators.Group.Finset.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.FieldSimp","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Ring"],"declarations":8,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.atomMass","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.atomMass","kind":"def","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/tower-binding-energy.lean#L69-L73","doc":"The atomic mass from the 3-channel tower.\nM(Z,N) = Z m_p + N m_n + Z m_e − B(Z,N). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.towerBinding","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.towerBinding","kind":"def","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/tower-binding-energy.lean#L60-L67","doc":"The binding energy from the 3-channel tower.\nB = Σ_λ w_λ m_e Σ_i ln|Φ_q(V̂_i^λ)|\nwhere the sum over i runs over generators and λ over channels. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:tower-binding-energy","label":"prop:tower-binding-energy","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/tower-binding-energy.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.bindingCoeff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.bindingCoeff","kind":"def","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/tower-binding-energy.lean#L51-L58","doc":"The binding energy coefficient is w_λ × m_e for each channel.\nNo fitted parameters: w_λ from Wedderburn, m_e from CODATA. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.quantumDilog","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.quantumDilog","kind":"def","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/tower-binding-energy.lean#L44-L49","doc":"The quantum dilogarithm Φ_q(x) = Π_{k≥1} |1 - q⁻ᵏx|⁻¹,\ndefined as the absolute value of the q-Pochhammer symbol.\nAnalytically continued past |x| = q via the functional equation\nof the q-Pochhammer symbol (a;q)_∞ = (1-a)(aq;q)_∞. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.wedderburnSymEqAlt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.wedderburnSymEqAlt","kind":"def","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/tower-binding-energy.lean#L40-L42","doc":"w_sym = w_alt (the symmetric and alternating weights are equal). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.wedderburnWeightsSum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.wedderburnWeightsSum","kind":"theorem","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/tower-binding-energy.lean#L33-L38","doc":"The three Wedderburn-Artin weights sum to 1. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.wedderburnSym","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.wedderburnSym","kind":"def","line":28,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/tower-binding-energy.lean#L28-L31","doc":"The Wedderburn-Artin weight of the symmetric (= alternating) irrep:\nw_sym = w_alt = 1 / ([2]_q² + 2). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.wedderburnStd","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.wedderburnStd","kind":"def","line":22,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/tower-binding-energy.lean#L22-L26","doc":"The Wedderburn-Artin weight of the standard irrep of H₃(q):\nw_std = [2]_q² / ([2]_q² + 2) where [2]_q = q + q⁻¹. ","signatureChunk":0}]}